	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"• 『THE ORIGIN』外伝漫画「ククルス・ドアンの島」に登場する局地型ガンダム（北米戦仕様）の改良型MSが豊富な新規武装でキット化！",
			"• FSDとは「Full Scale Development」の略語で「先行量産」を意味し、特徴的な腕部ガトリング、特殊な形状の胸部や印象的なシールドは新規で再現されている！"
		],
		"en": [
			"• An improved MS of the local Gundam (North American war spec) that appears in the side story \"THE ORIGIN\" comic \"The Island of Cucurrus Doan\" has been made into a kit with a wealth of new weapons!",
			"• FSD is an abbreviation for \"Full Scale Development\" and means \"advance mass production\", and the characteristic arm gatling, special shaped chest and impressive Seal do are all newly reproduced!"
		]
	},
